    "user_request_original": "Design a 29-layer planar dielectric filter on Fused Silica substrate with air incident medium. Layer sequence: Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao) (cavity defect layer), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao), SiO2 (Lemarchand), Ta2O5 (Gao). Optimize all 29 layer thicknesses with bounds 50-400 nm. Initialize cavity layer (layer 15) thickness in range 210-275 nm. Apply smoothness penalty with relaxation threshold 75 nm. Target: maximize transmittance at 1550 nm (soft target ≥ 0.95), minimize transmittance in 1400-1500 nm band, minimize transmittance in 1600-1700 nm band. Assume normal incidence, unpolarized light. Use coherent transfer-matrix method.",
